{"id":"84940566355062f6","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md","title":"算术层级","display":"df-arithmetical-hierarchy — 算术层级","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","aliases":["91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","91-df-arith-hierarchy"],"display":"df-arithmetical-hierarchy — 算术层级","depends_on":["[[91-df-ground-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</span><span>91-df-arith-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetical-hierarchy — 算术层级"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-arithmetical-hierarchy-—-算术层级-$\\Sigma_n/\\Pi_n$\">df-arithmetical-hierarchy — 算术层级 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n/\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n/\\Pi_n\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_0\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_0\\)</span> (基础语言, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BndFml}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{BndFml}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}\\)</span> (仅含有界量词的基础语言公式集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (Peano算术理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PNF}^{\\exists}_n,\\mathrm{PNF}^{\\forall}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PNF}^{\\exists}_n,\\mathrm{PNF}^{\\forall}_n\\)</span> (矩阵有界、恰有至多\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个交替无界量词块且首块分别为存在、全称的前束公式类)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\Sigma^0_0\\coloneqq\\Pi^0_0\\coloneqq\\Delta^0_0\n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BndFml}_{\\mathcal L_0},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\Sigma^0_0\\coloneqq\\Pi^0_0\\coloneqq\\Delta^0_0\n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BndFml}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\mid\n\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{PNF}^{\\exists}_n\\;\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\forall\\bar y(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\sigma)\\},\n\\qquad\n\\Pi^0_n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\mid\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{PNF}^{\\forall}_n\\;\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\forall\\bar y(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\pi)\\}\n\\quad(n\\ge 1),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma^0_n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\mid\n\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{PNF}^{\\exists}_n\\;\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\forall\\bar y(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\sigma)\\},\n\\qquad\n\\Pi^0_n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\mid\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{PNF}^{\\forall}_n\\;\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\forall\\bar y(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\pi)\\}\n\\quad(n\\ge 1),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^0_n\\coloneqq\\Sigma^0_n\\cap\\Pi^0_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta^0_n\\coloneqq\\Sigma^0_n\\cap\\Pi^0_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span> : 第<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>层存在式公式集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Pi_n\\)</span> : 第<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>层全称式公式集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_n\">\\(\\Delta_n\\)</span> : 既<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span>又<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Pi_n\\)</span>的公式集</li>\n</ul>\n<p>算术层级的含义：\n算术层级按量词交替深度分类公式。</p>\n<p>层级结构：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_0 = \\Pi^0_0 = \\Delta^0_0 = \\mathrm{BndFml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma^0_0 = \\Pi^0_0 = \\Delta^0_0 = \\mathrm{BndFml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1 = \\exists\\; \\mathrm{量化公式}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_1 = \\exists\\; \\mathrm{量化公式}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1 = \\forall\\; \\mathrm{量化公式}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi_1 = \\forall\\; \\mathrm{量化公式}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_2 = \\exists \\forall\\; \\mathrm{公式}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_2 = \\exists \\forall\\; \\mathrm{公式}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_2 = \\forall \\exists\\; \\mathrm{公式}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi_2 = \\forall \\exists\\; \\mathrm{公式}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>...</p>\n<p>层级与真理的关系：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>真理定义复杂度</th>\n<th>反射原则强度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span></td>\n<td>可<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_0\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_0\\)</span>中定义（相对）</td>\n<td>局部反射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span></td>\n<td>需要<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>层真理迭代</td>\n<td>统一反射</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>真理谓词的层级分析：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>本身不在算术层级中（超越层级）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>需要真理谓词</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-arithmetical-hierarchy-—-算术层级-$\\Sigma_n/\\Pi_n$","text":"df-arithmetical-hierarchy — 算术层级 $\\Sigma_n/\\Pi_n$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-